      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The constant noise of guilt is deafening, and the thought of ending it all seems like a quiet escape hatch. Your suffering is immense, and that feeling of being utterly responsible for the loss is crushing. If you are having thoughts of ending your life, please know that help is available immediately. You can connect with people who want to support you by calling or texting 988 in the US and Canada.",
