      "content": "The idea of escaping the shame is a powerful one, but that finality is a permanent choice you shouldn't have to make alone. Your honor isn't defined by the end of your life, but by the strength it takes to face this pain. Instead of choosing silence, consider letting someone help you bear this weight right now. Please reach out to a crisis line; they can listen without judgment.",
